<title>POLAND: PEKPOL SWINGS TO PLN 0.1 MLN JUNE LOSS.</title>
<headline>PEKPOL SWINGS TO PLN 0.1 MLN JUNE LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		-0.08 vs   0.28 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	  -0.11 vs   0.73 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	-0.10 vs   0.06 </p>
<p> Sales		   16.32 vs  15.06</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.02 vs   1.89</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.14 vs   2.74</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.02 vs   0.55</p>
<p> Sales		   92.49 vs  95.33</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food producer is Pekpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
